{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13541","headline":"登云中 · 元季川","name":"登云中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灌田东山下，取乐在尔休。\n清兴相引行，日日三四周。\n白鸥与我心，不厌此中游。\n穷览颇有适，不极趣无幽。\n憀然歌采薇，曲尽心悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元季川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}